`,(0,n.jsx)(o,{children:(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"I've completed the workflow improvement template. Please review my responses and help me understand: (1) How Claude can specifically address the challenges I've outlined, (2) Which Claude features would be most valuable (Extended Thinking, file creation, MCP connections), (3) A practical step-by-step workflow I can implement, (4) Any templates or examples I'll need."})}),`
